01:02:22.232 --> 01:02:22.392
Kenzo: [laughs]

01:02:22.392 --> 01:02:22.552
Delwath: [laughs]

01:02:24.232 --> 01:02:25.492
DM: So just be patient.

01:02:25.492 --> 01:02:27.512
