01:02:40.912 --> 01:02:40.972
DM: Can you-

01:02:41.012 --> 01:02:42.232
Delwath: Today is our day.

01:02:42.232 --> 01:02:42.372
Delwath: [laughs]

01:02:42.512 --> 01:02:43.852
Kenzo: Is it expe- can you tell...

01:02:43.852 --> 01:02:48.152
