01:02:56.592 --> 01:02:56.952
Delwath: Yeah, yeah.

01:02:56.972 --> 01:02:58.192
DM: And there's exactly that many.

01:02:58.272 --> 01:02:58.492
Delwath: Okay. Okay.

01:02:58.492 --> 01:03:00.212
