01:04:22.432 --> 01:04:22.552
DM: Um-

01:04:22.652 --> 01:04:22.792
Delwath: I mean-

01:04:22.792 --> 01:04:23.852
DM: ... it's only about a, it's like

01:04:24.972 --> 01:04:26.872
