Delwath: Well, now

01:06:45.972 --> 01:06:48.872
Seeker: ... in range to re-up it, right?

01:06:48.872 --> 01:06:50.432
Delwath: Yeah, we would have no contact.

01:06:51.292 --> 01:06:51.412
Kenzo: Well-

01:06:51.472 --> 01:06:51.912
Delwath: But that's a little tough

