01:46:18.542 --> 01:46:18.842
Delwath: Right.

01:46:18.862 --> 01:46:20.402
DM: It was definitely not that high.

01:46:20.442 --> 01:46:21.582
Delwath: Oh, not, not that high.

01:46:21.582 --> 01:46:22.562
Unknown: Not 50%.

01:46:22.642 --> 01:46:23.262
Delwath: Yeah. Mostly not.

01:46:23.262 --> 01:46:28.002
DM: Whether it's like, whether it's like 10% or 25% or something like that, it's hard to tell.

01:46:28.022 --> 01:46:28.142
Delwath: But-

01:46:28.142 --> 01:46:32.102
DM: But, like, clearly it's not like there's constant wars between the true believers-

01:46:32.122 --> 01:46:32.122
Delwath: Right

01:46:32.122 --> 01:46:33.622
DM: ... and the non-true believers on the-

01:46:33.942 --> 01:46:35.462
Delwath: The, the problem is any th...

01:46:35.462 --> 01:46:41.202
