01:46:49.542 --> 01:46:59.762
Kenzo: You know, the, the, the only useful thing about the any, quote-unquote, "rebellion" would be if we didn't want to have to fight the true believers and we had a bunch of other dragonets to, like, kind of, you know, whatever, dragonets civil war

01:46:59.762 --> 01:47:00.762
Unknown: so that we didn't have to deal with them.

01:47:00.842 --> 01:47:01.102
Delwath: Oh.

01:47:01.242 --> 01:47:01.282
Unknown: You know?

01:47:01.282 --> 01:47:02.842
