01:47:02.862 --> 01:47:03.422
Unknown: Yeah. Exactly.

01:47:03.462 --> 01:47:03.562
Delwath: Yeah.

01:47:03.582 --> 01:47:04.762
Unknown: Exactly. Just so we don't have to deal with them in return.

01:47:04.822 --> 01:47:06.462
Seeker: I mean, that's actually quite useful.

01:47:06.622 --> 01:47:08.362
Kenzo: That's true. Which is not nothing.

01:47:08.562 --> 01:47:10.242
Delwath: But it... I mean, but are we...

01:47:14.822 --> 01:47:15.602
Delwath: Are we...

01:47:17.282 --> 01:47:19.002
Delwath: So we could attempt-

