Unknown: No, no, the, the dragon would trade.

01:48:10.262 --> 01:48:10.842
Delwath: Ragabash.

01:48:11.022 --> 01:48:15.561
DM: Yeah. I mean, that's like the whole economy of the island is trading things to her for her favor.

01:48:15.602 --> 01:48:15.621
Delwath: Right.

01:48:15.621 --> 01:48:19.202
