01:48:22.602 --> 01:48:23.162
Delwath: Of course. Of course.

01:48:23.162 --> 01:48:24.022
Unknown: It would have to be something she wants-

01:48:24.322 --> 01:48:24.482
Delwath: Of course

01:48:24.482 --> 01:48:25.422
Unknown: ... really badly.

01:48:25.462 --> 01:48:26.182
Delwath: Of course.

01:48:26.182 --> 01:48:26.542
Unknown: So we can-

01:48:26.862 --> 01:48:28.302
Unknown: But 100%, like, definitely.

01:48:28.302 --> 01:48:32.082
Seeker: We could say we have, like, several more pieces of jade, but we just want the one she has.

01:48:32.302 --> 01:48:33.262
Unknown: We're not gonna give anything to her.

01:48:33.302 --> 01:48:36.782
Delwath: Well, but I think, I actually think if we're doing trade, we should do it honestly.

01:48:36.782 --> 01:48:39.302
Delwath: We should not attempt, right?

01:48:39.322 --> 01:48:39.442
Unknown: The, the-

01:48:39.462 --> 01:48:40.342
Unknown: We actually trade something to her?

01:48:40.382 --> 01:48:40.782
Unknown: Yeah.

01:48:40.802 --> 01:48:40.822
Unknown: Yeah.

01:48:40.822 --> 01:48:41.882
Unknown: The value, the, like-

01:48:41.962 --> 01:48:43.062
Unknown: What do we have that we could trade her?

01:48:43.322 --> 01:48:46.062
DM: The, like... You know, your sense is, like, it'd have to be at least, like, 10 to one.

01:48:46.122 --> 01:48:47.422
Unknown: Yeah. Totally. Of course.

01:48:47.462 --> 01:48:48.822
Unknown: But 10 to one might not-

01:48:48.842 --> 01:48:51.822
Kenzo: But she doesn't know that, that this is more than just jade, right?

01:48:51.822 --> 01:48:53.202
Unknown: I mean, she might know that it's magic jade.

01:48:53.242 --> 01:48:54.462
Unknown: She probably knows it's magical.

01:48:54.502 --> 01:48:55.942
Unknown: Yeah. But she doesn't know that it's, like-

01:48:56.222 --> 01:48:56.382
Unknown: But-

01:48:56.382 --> 01:48:56.742
Unknown: ... you know

01:48:56.742 --> 01:49:05.842
Delwath: ... if we were going to do a trade, the thing to do would be to actually go in amongst the dragonets and start offering out little bits of treasure for others of them, so we get a rumor of people who have a ton of stuff.

01:49:06.142 --> 01:49:06.342
Unknown: Mm-hmm.

01:49:06.382 --> 01:49:06.702
Delwath: And then-

01:49:06.722 --> 01:49:07.382
Unknown: That's already happening.

01:49:07.422 --> 01:49:11.862
Kenzo: No, but the question is, do we have actually, do we actually have something that we could trade that the dragon would even care about?

01:49:11.862 --> 01:49:15.662
Delwath: I mean, we'd have to poke around and see what we have, but we either would tr...

01:49:15.662 --> 01:49:19.662
