01:49:20.622 --> 01:49:21.802
Delwath: We have lots of gems,

01:49:22.702 --> 01:49:23.242
Delwath: right?

01:49:23.242 --> 01:49:24.042
Unknown: That is true.

01:49:25.142 --> 01:49:28.182
Delwath: Or we could try and think, do we have magic we don't actually need anymore?

01:49:28.402 --> 01:49:29.222
Unknown: Magic items.

01:49:29.282 --> 01:49:30.542
Delwath: Right? Like-

01:49:30.602 --> 01:49:36.562
DM: Just keep in mind, if you're offering to trade something that you have on you, there is always the, why doesn't she just kill you and take it?

01:49:36.942 --> 01:49:39.862
Delwath: Yeah, yeah. No, we'd have to have some plan for-

