Kenzo: But also is, if she's trapped, right?

01:49:42.842 --> 01:49:44.102
Unknown: I keep going back to that whole bit.

01:49:44.242 --> 01:49:47.742
Delwath: But it also goes back to kill us and take it, fine.

01:49:47.742 --> 01:49:48.902
Delwath: Like, but if-

01:49:48.962 --> 01:49:53.882
Kenzo: We want that. If she can leave the lair and come out and try to kill us, fucking come kill us and take it.

01:49:53.922 --> 01:49:54.022
Delwath: If, if-

01:49:54.022 --> 01:50:01.382
Kenzo: You know? That's the other thing we could do is just flaunt around and be like, "Hey, we're a bunch of dudes with, uh, all this fucking treasure, all this stuff.

01:50:01.382 --> 01:50:02.142
Unknown: Dragon, come get us."

01:50:02.162 --> 01:50:05.162
