01:50:09.002 --> 01:50:11.162
Seeker: I think it's Dragonets on our side, or at least some of them.

01:50:11.242 --> 01:50:11.542
Kenzo: Yeah

01:50:11.542 --> 01:50:19.942
Delwath: But I, but I think that plan works better if we're honestly willing to trade if she takes it, with a backup plan of basically trying to negotiate.

01:50:19.942 --> 01:50:21.662
Delwath: I mean, just being upfront with her.

01:50:21.662 --> 01:50:25.942
Delwath: Like, "Okay, we're willing to trade, but we don't wanna come in your lair and just get killed, so

01:50:26.722 --> 01:50:27.882
Delwath: what do you, what is your plan here?"

01:50:28.402 --> 01:50:28.702
Kenzo: Yeah.

01:50:28.782 --> 01:50:34.262
Delwath: And if we come across scary enough that she thinks that out of her lair it might even be a fair fight...

01:50:34.262 --> 01:50:44.082
