01:50:44.082 --> 01:50:44.622
Kenzo: Totally.

01:50:44.622 --> 01:50:44.902
Delwath: Right?

01:50:45.762 --> 01:50:46.462
Delwath: So I mean-

01:50:46.702 --> 01:50:51.242
Kenzo: Well, we... Uh, so far, I mean, the, uh, the only thing I've shown is like I've got a whistle and I can fly around.

01:50:51.302 --> 01:50:52.122
Delwath: Yeah, yeah. No, we haven't-

01:50:52.162 --> 01:50:53.442
Kenzo: That's, uh, there's no... And it's only game.

01:50:53.462 --> 01:50:54.382
Delwath: The, the strategy would be like-

