DM: But you're forgetting about the Dragonets.

01:51:26.642 --> 01:51:28.562
DM: If she thinks the Dragonets can just kill you,

01:51:29.462 --> 01:51:30.882
DM: why wouldn't she just send Dragonets after you?

01:51:30.942 --> 01:51:32.542
Delwath: Why wouldn't she send henchmen after us?

01:51:33.182 --> 01:51:33.522
Kenzo: Mm. Yeah.

01:51:33.542 --> 01:51:33.782
Delwath: Right?

01:51:33.862 --> 01:51:34.502
Kenzo: Uh.

01:51:34.502 --> 01:51:36.642
Delwath: I mean, we could maybe kill her hench...

01:51:36.642 --> 01:51:37.262
Delwath: Like, but

