Kenzo: But we can kill hundreds of Dragonets.

01:51:39.462 --> 01:51:40.302
DM: Can we?

01:51:40.302 --> 01:51:40.722
Kenzo: I think so.

01:51:41.442 --> 01:51:41.782
DM: Can we?

01:51:43.262 --> 01:51:44.002
Kenzo: Five of them, yeah.

01:51:44.662 --> 01:51:45.662
Delwath: I mean, I don't know. They were-

