Kenzo: Or hundreds at once might be tough

01:51:46.542 --> 01:51:48.242
DM: ... almost 10. 10, maybe But there probably aren't...

01:51:48.242 --> 01:51:50.602
DM: I mean, who knows? Like there's, if there's 500 of them,

