Kenzo: Yeah. We do not wanna fight her... In the acid lair, that sounds so gnarly.

01:52:42.602 --> 01:52:43.742
Kenzo: That sounds just like horrible.

01:52:43.742 --> 01:52:43.802
DM: Ooh, that's terrible.

01:52:43.842 --> 01:52:45.462
Delwath: This is like the opposite of the last dragon fight.

01:52:45.482 --> 01:52:45.562
Kenzo: It's the worst.

01:52:45.562 --> 01:52:50.162
Delwath: I was like, "We need a way to get him out of the lair," and all three of you were like, "No, no, no, we're just gonna fight in the lair."

01:52:50.162 --> 01:52:50.202
Delwath: [laughs]

01:52:50.202 --> 01:52:51.722
Unknown: Yeah, we'll be fine with that one.

