01:52:54.922 --> 01:52:55.042
Delwath: True.

01:52:55.062 --> 01:52:58.782
DM: The problem with fighting a dragon out of the lair is that they can just fly above you-

01:52:58.882 --> 01:52:59.002
Delwath: Yeah

01:52:59.002 --> 01:53:00.322
DM: ... and breathe on you from above.

01:53:00.322 --> 01:53:00.322
Delwath: Yep. We did.

01:53:00.322 --> 01:53:00.762
DM: You're just dead.

01:53:01.062 --> 01:53:01.382
Kenzo: Yeah.

01:53:01.402 --> 01:53:02.002
Delwath: Right.

01:53:02.002 --> 01:53:03.042
DM: You have to be able to fly.

01:53:03.042 --> 01:53:04.042
Delwath: True. But we can fly pretty well.

01:53:04.042 --> 01:53:06.282
DM: But you have easy... You all have easy ways to fly, so...

01:53:07.222 --> 01:53:11.122
Kenzo: All right. So, um, but do we s- do we now still go and talk to the elves to learn more about like-

01:53:11.182 --> 01:53:11.702
Delwath: I think so.

01:53:11.702 --> 01:53:12.282
Kenzo: I think so too, right?

01:53:12.302 --> 01:53:12.962
Delwath: Yeah. I think the next move-

01:53:12.962 --> 01:53:15.242
Kenzo: 'Cause, 'cause now there's like we gotta figure out like what the fuck is going on.

01:53:15.262 --> 01:53:15.442
Delwath: Yeah.

01:53:15.442 --> 01:53:16.802
Kenzo: Like is it trapped? Is it...

01:53:16.802 --> 01:53:22.822
