01:53:35.242 --> 01:53:35.602
Kenzo: Yeah.

01:53:36.102 --> 01:53:36.222
Delwath: Yeah.

01:53:36.222 --> 01:53:37.142
Kenzo: All right. Let's go talk to the elves.

01:53:37.562 --> 01:53:40.062
Delwath: And we're not even sure she can leave her lair, right?

01:53:40.922 --> 01:53:42.422
Kenzo: Right. Exactly. I mean, that was a...

01:53:42.422 --> 01:53:43.422
Kenzo: Nobody's seen her, right?

01:53:43.462 --> 01:53:43.542
Delwath: Right.

01:53:43.542 --> 01:53:46.282
Kenzo: So I double-check with all of them. Has anybody ever seen her outside of the lair?

01:53:47.422 --> 01:53:54.022
