Delwath: She did something to do something to make people at least think that there's an acid pool, right?

01:54:04.822 --> 01:54:07.722
Seeker: But is that a thing? I'm checking Delwath's paranoia here.

01:54:07.742 --> 01:54:09.682
Seeker: Is that a thing, like remote acid pools?

01:54:10.122 --> 01:54:10.462
DM: I mean,

01:54:11.422 --> 01:54:14.082
DM: ancient dragons can have all sorts of magic.

01:54:14.082 --> 01:54:16.262
DM: Yeah, they could do a, pretty much anything.

